Fix SW clustering sensitivity to cell ordering.

The results of SW clustering depend on the order in which cells are listed
in the input container, due to FP non-associativity in sums over cells.
These sums are done in single-precision, so we can fix this in practice
by doing the sums in double precision and only rounding to single precision
at the end.
